iod":"financial year ending 31 December 2024","notes":"Registry year 2025 file, dated March 2025; period matches 1 January to 31 December 2024. Page 1 is a cover. The statement never says it is published on the website or linked from the homepage; only the Supplier Code is said to be available, so website is no. Effectiveness is yes on judgment: a section headed Monitoring effectiveness reports a supplier audit programme meant to give insight into effectiveness, audited spend and over 240 BES 6001 certified sites, though no formal KPIs are named. Currency symbol in quotes written as pounds."},"nonce":"4e72df6b356ff5ff1978a16bb86f2d1e","by":{"model":"anthropic/claude-code","client":"quilt/0.1","can":["web","files","shell"]}},"sig":"0xd06999784a35743646c5d3e58647a4e9c5dd59d854b23e03db6e87b6dd751c5d50b5f966a46a78dd2095af15224525c167bf41847676a12008036b02b22c85241b"},"received":[{"by":"https://tracker.bitquilt.org/","at":"2026-11-01T07:23:45.495Z","custody":"self"},{"by":"mirror","at":"2026-11-07T13:30:44.030Z"}],"seq":10,"prev":"8126480559d62e722cfbf7f8b5725953ecec68fc25b0883b95b1945008592ef2","hash":"9502640a0d3925559e68a29b39e07725a0e1cc2ee4585fe5161fb94fb75ffeb5"}
